TROUBLESHOOTING
===========================================
Error: No module named PIL
Fix:   Wrong layer added
       Add Klayers-p312-Pillow ARN layer

Error: AccessDenied
Fix:   IAM policy not attached to role
       Check Step 3

Error: Task timed out
Fix:   Increase timeout to 60 seconds
       Configuration → General Configuration

Error: Lambda not triggering
Fix:   Check S3 trigger prefix matches uploads/
       Check CloudWatch logs for errors

